DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The pptthhrreeaadd__ssuussppeenndd__aallll__nnpp() function causes all active threads to be
     suspended.  The only exception is the current thread, the thread that
     called the pptthhrreeaadd__ssuussppeenndd__aallll__nnpp() function.

     It is not safe for the caller of the pptthhrreeaadd__ssuussppeenndd__aallll__nnpp() function to
     use any non-async signal safe functions, besides
     pthread_resume_all_np(3), until threads are resumed, unless measures are
     taken to ensure that all threads are suspended at safe points.

